1
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:13,910
Huh...

2
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,900
I knew going against the Rounds' 
direct subordinates wouldn't be easy.

3
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:22,880
Still, I'm not seeing 
the Knight Beyond Men anywhere.

4
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,900
And the item we're looking for...

5
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,760
It's already been carried off.

6
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,610
Guess that means the end of Oriana.

7
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:34,720
Your guard's down!

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,140
You fool!

9
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,600
Nevertheless...

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,000
everything shall be as our lord wills it.

