901
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,710
<i>To sum up what I learned yesterday...</i><i></i>

902
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:32,970
<i>Apparently Rose's hands are tied 
because Perv has taken her mother hostage.</i><i></i>

903
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:37,710
<i>Frankly, I wonder why she'd let that bother her 
after she's come so far.</i><i></i>

904
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:41,900
<i>But I figure I can just chalk it up 
to Rose's personal aesthetic.</i><i></i>

905
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,420
<i>The solution is simple.</i>

906
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:49,000
<i>I just have to use my Eminence in Shadow moves 
to free the hostage myself.</i>

907
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,860
<i>Thus, I will remove Rose's shackles,</i><i></i>

908
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:56,030
<i>and we're sure to get one step closer 
to the birth of the legendary tyrant.</i>

909
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:58,910
I was so worried about you yesterday, 
Mr. Apprentice.

910
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:03,790
After you got lost on my watch, 
I couldn't sleep a wink for being so distraught.

911
00:03:03,790 --> 00:03:04,790
I see.

912
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:08,130
And lately, there's been this creepy guard 
following me around.

913
00:03:08,130 --> 00:03:11,000
You can hardly call 
the castle grounds safe anymore.

914
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,880
I see.

915
00:03:12,170 --> 00:03:14,090
But don't you worry!

916
00:03:14,090 --> 00:03:15,380
That stalker...

917
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,040
The frightening man is gone now.

918
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:17,950
I see.

919
00:03:17,950 --> 00:03:19,880
He's been formally accused of stealing food.

920
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:22,800
No one saw him do it, 
but we all know it was him.

921
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,850
I see...

922
00:03:24,850 --> 00:03:28,130
I did everything I could for you, 
Mr. Apprentice.

923
00:03:28,130 --> 00:03:30,910
Rest assured, I will protect you 
and keep you safe.

924
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:32,500
From that scary stalker,

925
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:36,610
and from that woman who claims to be your teacher 
but really wants to crush your talent.

926
00:03:36,610 --> 00:03:37,750
Oh, my...

927
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:41,490
Who exactly wants to crush whose talent now?

928
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:46,500
My, my. If it isn't Miss Shiron!

929
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,290
I thought you were 
in the middle of a recital?

930
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:50,000
It's intermission.

931
00:03:50,210 --> 00:03:53,960
And I was worried someone might be distracting 
my darling student from his duties.

932
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,930
I assure you those worries 
are totally unfounded

933
00:03:56,930 --> 00:04:00,710
because I'm here to support Mr. Apprentice 
in everything that he needs.

934
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:03,390
Do you really need people 
to spell things out for you?

935
00:04:03,390 --> 00:04:06,040
Perhaps your head is full of flowers 
blooming or something?

936
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,850
My, how frightening!

937
00:04:06,210 --> 00:04:07,850
<i>Nature versus nurture...</i>

938
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:09,710
<i>They never get along.</i>

939
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:11,710
<i>I guess that's true no matter where you go.</i>

940
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:23,240
They may be on the verge of war.

941
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:25,200
How can they be so nonchalant?

942
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:29,670
It does seem like the palace dwellers 
are pretty unconcerned about everything.

943
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:32,610
The nobility detests violence 
and adores the arts.

944
00:04:32,610 --> 00:04:34,550
That's how it's been 
throughout Oriana's history...

945
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,900
because of the Black Rose.

946
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,510
The Black Rose...

947
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,470
We are...

948
00:04:41,710 --> 00:04:43,430
...the Black Rose Brotherhood!

949
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:45,790
The Black Rose Brotherhood!

950
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:47,390
The Black Rose Brotherhood!

951
00:04:48,090 --> 00:04:50,100
That was kinda different.

952
00:04:50,410 --> 00:04:53,010
Well, I'd like to see the real deal.

953
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:55,570
Do you really mean that, my lord?

954
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,170
Of course.

955
00:04:57,170 --> 00:04:58,880
It's here, isn't it?

956
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:02,110
Well, you're right about that.

957
00:05:02,110 --> 00:05:04,790
But it's far too dangerous...

958
00:05:04,790 --> 00:05:07,710
Still, if we want to totally destroy it...

959
00:05:08,460 --> 00:05:09,290
No...

960
00:05:10,290 --> 00:05:13,200
If that is your choice, Lord Shadow.

961
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,670
<i>That's my Epsilon!</i>

962
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:22,930
<i>I'm just curious about seeing the flowers, 
and she makes it sound like the most dramatic thing in the world.</i><i></i>

963
00:05:23,540 --> 00:05:26,430
<i>Anyway, I'm interested 
in seeing a black rose...</i><i></i>

964
00:05:26,890 --> 00:05:30,110
<i>but finding Queen Reina comes first.</i>

965
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:34,500
They're awfully procreative 
for the middle of the day.

966
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,600
Stop that.

967
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,420
We see nothing, hear nothing, 
and think nothing.

968
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:39,820
But the kingdom 
won't last long if this keeps up.

969
00:05:43,780 --> 00:05:45,410
Tell me, darling.

970
00:05:45,410 --> 00:05:48,210
Can't we get them to accept our love yet?

971
00:05:48,210 --> 00:05:50,000
Just a little while longer, honey.

972
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,750
Once the wedding is over, 
we'll have no more use for Rose.

973
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:55,920
Be honest, she's the one you want to marry.

974
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,000
You're the only one I love.

975
00:05:58,670 --> 00:06:02,840
You'll kill her as soon as you're done with her, 
and then marry me, won't you?

976
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,400
Of course I will, sugarpops.

977
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,790
<i>This is no good at all.</i>

978
00:06:08,790 --> 00:06:11,900
<i>It's changed from an isekai fantasy 
to a daytime soap opera.</i>

979
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:16,500
I have to find a way to course-correct 
back to that 6PM time slot.

980
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,900
Course...

981
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:22,860
Well, it's a pretty complicated 
family matter.

982
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:26,090
And if I know Rose, 
if she just finds out the truth,

983
00:06:26,090 --> 00:06:30,130
her rage will drive her to a full awakening 
as the tyrant I know she can be.

984
00:06:30,130 --> 00:06:30,910
Yeah.

985
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,290
Here.

986
00:06:34,670 --> 00:06:36,200
If you'll excuse me.

987
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:37,500
Margaret...

988
00:06:38,050 --> 00:06:39,460
What?

989
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:41,040
Nothing, I just...

990
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:43,200
If it's nothing, then I'll take my leave.

991
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:54,900
That girl will never smile at me again.

992
00:06:55,170 --> 00:06:56,380
Even so...

993
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:59,190
At least, for my father's sake...

994
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:03,000
If I can save my mother...

995
00:07:20,300 --> 00:07:21,300
Lord...

996
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Lord Shadow...

997
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:29,910
Are you here to kill me?

998
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,350
I...

999
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:38,310
I returned your kindness with betrayal.

1000
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:40,500
Please have mercy.

1001
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,120
Come with me.

1002
00:07:49,750 --> 00:07:51,580
I will show you the truth.

1003
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,500
The truth...

1004
00:08:00,090 --> 00:08:01,340
Oh, Perv...

1005
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:04,550
Soon, the kingdom will be all ours, 
won't it, darling?

1006
00:08:05,210 --> 00:08:08,200
Yes, honey, and it's all thanks to you.

1007
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:12,840
It was worth keeping 
that idiot husband of mine drugged.

1008
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:15,560
He made such a lovely puppet.

1009
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,560
If she hadn't killed him, 
he could've done more for us!

1010
00:08:18,810 --> 00:08:22,000
We should've taken care of Rose first.

1011
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:24,900
We have more work to do because of her.

1012
00:08:27,610 --> 00:08:29,800
Oh, Perv! Perv!

1013
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:35,420
This is the truth.

1014
00:08:35,420 --> 00:08:38,210
No! My mother would never...

1015
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,000
You must accept it.

1016
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:44,300
The time is ripe.

1017
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:46,500
What did your eyes show you?

1018
00:08:47,810 --> 00:08:50,500
What do you hold in your hands?

1019
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,500
Rise, Tyrant.

1020
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,890
Unleash the blade of rebellion and...

1021
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:07,900
This is your chance 
to eliminate the traitors...

1022
00:09:08,380 --> 00:09:10,660
I'm here to help...

1023
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:14,620
Well, yeah.

1024
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:17,580
I'm sorry, I guess.

1025
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:33,640
I...

1026
00:09:34,630 --> 00:09:35,640
What was the point?

1027
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:37,640
Those men...

1028
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:39,640
My father...

1029
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,090
I want to go back.

1030
00:09:54,130 --> 00:09:55,630
Let me go back!

1031
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:57,950
Let me go back to those happy days!

1032
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,750
My dear Cid!

1033
00:10:35,170 --> 00:10:36,500
Cid...

1034
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:38,900
Oh, Cid...

1035
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:42,090
Let's run away together,

1036
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:45,300
to a faraway world no one's heard of.

1037
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:48,000
I killed my father,

1038
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,630
I was betrayed by my mother,

1039
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:51,400
I betrayed my organization,

1040
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,200
and I have been forsaken by my people.

1041
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:56,500
But you, Cid...

1042
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:59,000
You're the only one who has stayed 
with me through it all,

1043
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,410
no matter what.

1044
00:11:01,210 --> 00:11:03,600
So I know, as long as I have you...

1045
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:07,000
I like this piece.

1046
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:10,600
It makes it so much easier to see the world.

1047
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:13,280
See the world?

1048
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:15,990
I've divided the world into two categories.

1049
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:19,100
The things that matter, 
and the things that don't.

1050
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:22,250
But... why?

1051
00:11:22,710 --> 00:11:25,960
Because I had a dream 
that would never come true if I didn't.

1052
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,750
A dream...

1053
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:32,800
We only have so much time, 
and so much effort.

1054
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:36,310
So, I dedicated all of it to what mattered,

1055
00:11:36,310 --> 00:11:38,720
and I cut myself loose from everything else.

1056
00:11:39,090 --> 00:11:40,600
"What mattered"?

1057
00:11:41,250 --> 00:11:43,600
You did all of that for me?

1058
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,000
But there is too much static 
to let us do that.

1059
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:51,000
The static clouds the world, 
and hides the things that matter.

1060
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:55,610
It's so easy for people 
to lose sight of what's really important.

1061
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:59,250
If you ask me, the world is too bright.

1062
00:11:59,250 --> 00:12:03,610
You see too many things, 
and that's why you lose track of what matters.

1063
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:04,620
That's...

1064
00:12:05,310 --> 00:12:11,000
That's why I think the illumination 
from the moon is just right for our world.

1065
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:16,300
It makes everyone look more closely, 
so they don't lose sight of what matters.

1066
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:21,800
We just need to stand in the moonlight, 
only seeing the things that matter.

1067
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,600
And so...

1068
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:28,270
In this world lit by the moon, 
what is it that you see?

1069
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:36,500
Cid...

1070
00:12:46,590 --> 00:12:48,040
My dear Cid...

1071
00:12:50,380 --> 00:12:51,600
I...

1072
00:12:52,590 --> 00:12:54,500
I lost the ring.

1073
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,380
Did somebody steal it from me?

1074
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:58,010
Ugh, how dare they?!

1075
00:12:58,010 --> 00:13:01,670
<i>Well, let's just say I spend money 
as fast as I make it.</i>

1076
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:04,500
<i>I did what I could to convince Rose.</i>

1077
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:06,540
<i>If she has the heart of a lion,</i>

1078
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:10,000
<i>then she will pull herself up 
and raise the banner of rebellion.</i>

1079
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,340
<i>I think.</i>

1080
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:12,310
<i>Probably.</i>

1081
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:16,540
Epsilon?

1082
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:19,400
I'll scrub your back for you, Lord Shadow.

1083
00:13:24,830 --> 00:13:29,400
<i>Her slime body has evolved to the point 
where you could mistake it for the real thing.</i>

1084
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,290
I'm a little embarrassed.

1085
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:33,400
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

1086
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,380
The consistency and shape are superb.

1087
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:37,260
You have done well to reach this level.

1088
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,220
It just happened naturally.

1089
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:44,040
There was a slightly 
unexpected development today.

1090
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,440
Oh, my! I hope everything is all right.

1091
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,220
I think there probably won't be a problem.

1092
00:13:48,610 --> 00:13:50,500
I've given her the key.

1093
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:52,880
If she has the strength to pull herself up,

1094
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:55,610
the banner of rebellion 
will rise of its own accord.

1095
00:13:55,610 --> 00:13:56,670
The key?

1096
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:58,040
You gave it to her?

1097
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:00,200
No wonder we couldn't find it.

1098
00:14:00,590 --> 00:14:02,600
The decisive battle will be in three days.

1099
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,200
At the wedding.

1100
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:08,900
The sleeping lion will wake.

1101
00:14:10,710 --> 00:14:14,910
<i>I mean, three days should be enough time 
to process her emotions, right?</i>

1102
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:17,960


1103
00:14:24,290 --> 00:14:25,960
Cancel the damn wedding!

1104
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,590
Drag that phony princess off her throne!

1105
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:28,850
Disband the parliament!

1106
00:14:29,530 --> 00:14:32,630
Anyone who speaks out against Princess Rose 
is a part of the resistance!

1107
00:14:32,630 --> 00:14:33,900
Fire!

1108
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:41,040
I'm almost there.

1109
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:43,240
Soon, the loose ends will all be tied up.

1110
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:46,700
Thinking back on it, 
I did run into some unforeseen complications.

1111
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:51,310
I had no trouble using that fool of a woman 
to make the king my puppet, but...

1112
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,090
That blasted Geerk.

1113
00:14:53,090 --> 00:14:56,670
How could I have known he would risk 
his own well-being to tamper with the ring?

1114
00:14:57,130 --> 00:15:02,200
He transferred ownership of the Ring of Succession 
from himself to Princess Rose.

1115
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:05,500
Sir Mordred said that, 
to become the owner of the ring myself,

1116
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:10,600
I will need to marry Rose 
and integrate my blood into the royal line.

1117
00:15:11,130 --> 00:15:14,210
I can't deny that is exactly how 
I'd expect an artifact to behave,

1118
00:15:14,210 --> 00:15:16,560
but I do loathe that it must work that way.

1119
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:19,500
But regardless of the means, 
the ends will be worth it,

1120
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:22,530
for now I, too, will be part of the Rounds!

1121
00:15:32,010 --> 00:15:35,300
Now I, too, will be part of the Rounds!

1122
00:15:39,210 --> 00:15:40,600
The Rounds!

1123
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,610
Hold on...

1124
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:47,720
Wait! Just wait a minute!

1125
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,170
Wait j-just a darn, just wait a minute!

1126
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:50,140
Wait a minute! What?!

1127
00:15:50,390 --> 00:15:51,850
Wh-Wh-Where did it go?!

1128
00:15:51,850 --> 00:15:53,590
Where? What? How in the...

1129
00:15:53,590 --> 00:15:54,790
Wh-Wh-Where?

1130
00:15:54,790 --> 00:15:56,000
I can't find it!

1131
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,800
It's gone.

1132
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:01,710
I've lost it?

1133
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,650
Perv Asshat...

1134
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:09,290
Sir Mordred!

1135
00:16:09,290 --> 00:16:12,490
Rejoice. The arrangements 
have been completed on this end.

1136
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:15,510
Once the ceremony is over,

1137
00:16:15,510 --> 00:16:20,460
the twelfth seat in Rounds will be yours.

1138
00:16:20,460 --> 00:16:21,900
Y-Yes, sir!

1139
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,420
I have high hopes for you,

1140
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,680
Perv Asshat.

1141
00:16:30,620 --> 00:16:33,000
I-I-It's...

1142
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:38,650
It's... It's not like I'll need 
the Ring of Succession right away!

1143
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:43,800
I'll come up with some kind of excuse 
to delay the exchange of rings.

1144
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:46,010
Yes, that's what I'll do!

1145
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:14,810
It wasn't time for her to go down the aisle.

1146
00:17:14,810 --> 00:17:16,380
Don't worry about it.

1147
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:20,440
This is just a formality to abdicate everything 
to Duke Asshat anyway.

1148
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,700
Perv Asshat...

1149
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:38,290
Do you take Rose Oriana to be your wife,

1150
00:17:38,290 --> 00:17:41,210
to have and to hold, 
in sickness and in health,

1151
00:17:41,210 --> 00:17:44,960
for richer or poorer, 
to love and to cherish,

1152
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:48,200
'til death do you part?

1153
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,130
Huh? Uh, yeah, I do.

1154
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,290
Rose Oriana, do you takeâ

1155
00:17:52,290 --> 00:17:53,260
I do not.

1156
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:57,220
Huh?

1157
00:17:57,590 --> 00:17:59,680
I said, "I do not."

1158
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,500
Ridiculous!

1159
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:04,110
How dare you say that?!

1160
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:07,460
I murdered the king, betrayed my kingdom,

1161
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:09,650
and swore allegiance 
to a shadowy organization.

1162
00:18:10,290 --> 00:18:11,880
I do not excuse myself.

1163
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:14,120
I accept everything.

1164
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:17,580
My guilt, my mistakes, all of it.

1165
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:21,290
But before it's over, 
I want to make things right.

1166
00:18:21,630 --> 00:18:23,250
Duke Perv Asshat...

1167
00:18:24,290 --> 00:18:26,210
I pronounce you guilty.

1168
00:18:26,610 --> 00:18:27,810
What?

1169
00:18:27,810 --> 00:18:31,250
You manipulated my father, 
the King of Oriana.

1170
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:34,290
You defiled the queen, 
and you plotted to overthrow the government.

1171
00:18:34,290 --> 00:18:37,420
How dare you?! Do you have any proof?

1172
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:39,000
No, I do not.

1173
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:42,140
But you know I don't need it.

1174
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:44,880
Do you think this is a game? 
I have a hostage!

1175
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:45,610
Don't you get it?!

1176
00:18:46,210 --> 00:18:48,420
Be a good girl and marry me, then I'llâ

1177
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,710
I cannot do that.

1178
00:18:50,750 --> 00:18:52,540
Y-You little...

1179
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:54,030
Whatever else may happen,

1180
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:57,000
I refuse to give up on true love.

1181
00:18:57,410 --> 00:19:01,100
I swear it on this ring he left me!

1182
00:19:02,250 --> 00:19:03,160
Impossible!

1183
00:19:10,810 --> 00:19:12,090
What is...

1184
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,890
Is this thing on? Is it recording?

1185
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:30,300
Father, please forgive your foolish son.

1186
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:34,900
I, Geerk, will now carry out 
my final act as king.

1187
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:37,000
It can't be...

1188
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:38,460
Geerk!

1189
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:40,810
Attention all citizens of Oriana.

1190
00:19:40,810 --> 00:19:45,880
By the time you hear this confession, 
I may have already passed on.

1191
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:48,460
I feel my mind whittling away every day,

1192
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:51,130
and soon, I will likely have lost 
all my senses.

1193
00:19:51,130 --> 00:19:54,920
But before that happens, 
I want to tell you the truth.

1194
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:58,750
The reason I'm losing my mind 
is because I am being drugged.

1195
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,670
I don't know how.

1196
00:20:00,670 --> 00:20:05,020
I asked my wife Reina to trade out 
my food, but it didn't help.

1197
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:08,210
Nothing helped.

1198
00:20:08,210 --> 00:20:10,770
But I know who is behind it.

1199
00:20:11,210 --> 00:20:13,340
Duke Perv Asshat.

1200
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:19,540
The Kingdom of Oriana is under the control 
of the enormous organization that backs him.

1201
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:22,210
Surely many of you thought it strange.

1202
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:21,210
They're seeing this outside?

1203
00:20:21,210 --> 00:20:22,100
Yes.

1204
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:24,130
And most likely, even outside the capital.

1205
00:20:22,210 --> 00:20:25,710
He is merely the adopted son 
of the Asshat line.

1206
00:20:24,130 --> 00:20:25,590
That's not good.

1207
00:20:25,590 --> 00:20:28,540
The insurgents 
might start looking at us next.

1208
00:20:25,710 --> 00:20:31,100
How did he get to the center of the Oriana government 
in such a short period of time?

1209
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:29,320
Then?

1210
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:31,600
Get in touch with Grantz and his people.

1211
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:33,050
I intend to fight to protect this kingdom,

1212
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:35,300
I'll be damned if I'm going to 
keep sucking up to that nobody.

1213
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:36,010
to protect all of you, to the bitter end.

1214
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:40,510
Even if I personally am defeated, 
you have nothing to fear.

1215
00:20:40,510 --> 00:20:44,540
I leave this kingdom's future in the hands 
of the one I trust more than anyone.

1216
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:45,480
My daughter.

1217
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:49,110
Rose Oriana will be your new leader.

1218
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:53,500
No matter what may happen, 
I want you to believe in her.

1219
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:59,100
Knowing her, she will most certainly 
lead this country down the right path.

1220
00:20:59,670 --> 00:21:04,410
Rose, the future of this kingdom 
is in your hands.

1221
00:21:07,210 --> 00:21:10,700
Rose, my daughter...

1222
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:13,340
I love you.

1223
00:21:21,290 --> 00:21:23,220
That... That's nonsense!

1224
00:21:23,630 --> 00:21:25,100
You expect us to believe that?!

1225
00:21:25,100 --> 00:21:26,180
That ridiculousâ

1226
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:28,640
Perv Asshat is a traitor!

1227
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:31,500
Give the crown back to its rightful owner!

1228
00:21:31,500 --> 00:21:33,900
Let fall the hammer of justice!

1229
00:21:32,630 --> 00:21:33,900
You bastards!

1230
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:38,290
You were happy enough to accept favors from me, 
and now you're ready to throw me toâ

1231
00:21:38,290 --> 00:21:40,110
Duke Perv Asshat!

1232
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:44,330
As the Princess of the Oriana Kingdom...

1233
00:21:44,330 --> 00:21:47,330
As she who has been entrusted 
with our nation's future...

1234
00:21:49,540 --> 00:21:53,130
I, Rose Oriana, pronounce you guilty!

1235
00:21:53,670 --> 00:21:54,600
Silence!

1236
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:55,960
Guards, what are you doing?!

1237
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:56,960
Seize this woman!

1238
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:59,000
Why aren't any of you moving?

1239
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:59,000
Hey, isn't it over yet?

1240
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:01,050
Your Majesty, we need to get you toâ

1241
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,000
Perv?

1242
00:22:24,210 --> 00:22:25,250
Mother!

1243
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:26,780
Honestly...

1244
00:22:27,040 --> 00:22:29,750
I had thought I could get 
a little more use out of him.

1245
00:22:29,750 --> 00:22:33,210
Incompetent allies 
are more trouble than foes.

1246
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:37,460
Don't you agree, new ruler of Oriana?

1247
00:22:37,710 --> 00:22:39,000
Who are you?

1248
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:43,160
Mordred, the Knight Beyond Men, 
the Ninth Seat of Rounds.

1249
00:22:44,380 --> 00:22:47,590
Accept my heartiest congratulations 
on your key succession ceremony.

1250
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:50,700
Now, I can finally open the door.

1251
00:22:51,020 --> 00:22:52,300
What are you...

1252
00:22:53,500 --> 00:22:54,500
What?!

1253
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:58,340
There is no need for the possessor of the key 
and the user of the device to be the same person.

1254
00:22:58,340 --> 00:23:02,600
All I need is for conditions to be right 
for the signal to reach its destination.

1255
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:05,160
Again?!

1256
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:29,770
Is that...

1257
00:23:29,770 --> 00:23:30,930
It can't be!

1258
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:33,880
This is the truth behind the legend.

1259
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:37,900
The monster that wiped out 
a hundred thousand Velgaltan troops in a single night.

1260
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:39,860
The Black Rose.

1261
00:23:45,310 --> 00:23:47,840
"Eliminate all witnesses."

1262
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:50,300
That is the law of the Cult.

1263
00:23:50,800 --> 00:23:52,380
Now, come forth!

1264
00:23:52,380 --> 00:23:54,630
Grand Ruler of the Fourth Realm!

1265
00:23:55,710 --> 00:23:57,220
Ragnarok!

1266
00:24:14,420 --> 00:24:17,290
Let the banquet of slaughter begin!

1267
00:24:18,300 --> 00:24:20,020
Crush them all...

1268
00:24:20,300 --> 00:24:22,700
Archfiend Ragnarok!

